{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10208","headline":"晚发咸阳寄同院遗补 · 李嘉佑","name":"晚发咸阳寄同院遗补","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"征战初休草又衰，咸阳晚眺泪堪垂。\n去路全无千里客，秋田不见五陵儿。\n秦家故事随流水，汉代高坟对石碑。\n回首青山独不语，羡君谈笑万年枝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李嘉佑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10208.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10208","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}